## 9. Retry from offline screen shows a black WebView

**Symptom:** Tapping Retry returns to a blank/black WebView.

**Cause:** `StreamPortal` is `singleTask`; Retry reuses the existing instance
via `onNewIntent`, but the WebView was set to `about:blank` when going offline,
and `onNewIntent` only handled push URLs.

**Fix:** in `onNewIntent` reload the stream URL when the current page is blank:
```kotlin
override fun onNewIntent(i: Intent) {
    super.onNewIntent(i); setIntent(i); navigatedOffline = false
    val target = i.getStringExtra(EXTRA_STREAM_URL) ?: vault.destinationUrl
    val cur = wv.url
    if (!target.isNullOrBlank() &&
        (cur.isNullOrBlank() || cur == "about:blank" || cur != target))
        wv.loadUrl(target)
}
```

