## 10. Safe-area CSS kill breaks site button styling

**Symptom:** Site buttons become thin/squashed after injecting safe-area CSS.

**Cause:** a universal `*{padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important}`
selector strips padding from every element.

**Fix:** target ONLY root containers + safe-area CSS vars, never `*`:
```css
:root{--safe-area-inset-top:0px!important; --sat:0px!important; /* ...all vars */}
html,body,#__nuxt,#__layout,#app,#root{padding-top:0!important;
  padding-left:0!important;padding-right:0!important;margin-top:0!important;}
```
Re-apply on `pushState`/`replaceState`/`popstate` and a 2500ms interval.

